      "description": "Cruiseman's Garage — The App is the all-in-one companion built specifically for Honda Gold Wing GL1800 riders. Whether you ride every weekend or tour cross-country, it keeps your motorcycle road-ready, your records organized, and your fellow riders close by — all from your pocket.\n\nDAILY INSPECTIONS\nStart every ride with confidence. Walk through a guided pre-ride safety checklist covering tires, lights, fluids, brakes, and controls. Each item is animated and easy to tap Pass or Fail, and every completed inspection is saved to a history you can review or print anytime.\n\nMAINTENANCE SCHEDULE & LOG\nNever miss a service interval again. Follow the factory-based maintenance schedule for your GL1800, record completed work against your odometer, and keep a permanent maintenance history. A built-in DCT initialization guide is included for dual-clutch models.\n\nFUEL LOG & ECONOMY\nTrack every fill-up. Log fuel by grade (87, 89, 91, 93), record volume, cost, and odometer readings, and let the app calculate your fuel economy and running totals automatically. Choose litres, US gallons, or Imperial gallons and view your data on a clean, dashboard-style display.\n\nRIDE TRACKS\nRecord your journeys as GPX track logs, even while the app runs in the background. Import and review tracks, set your own GPS sampling interval, and export your rides to share or archive.\n\nMEETUPS\nConnect with other Gold Wing riders near you. Opt in to Meetups, share your location and heading, and send a digital contact card by Mail or Messages so new riding friends can reach you. Your participation is always optional and under your control.\n\nTRIP RECORDS & COSTS\nKeep a log of your trips and the costs that go with them — fuel, food, lodging, and any custom categories you create. Perfect for touring riders who want to know what a journey really cost.\n\nBIKES & PHOTOS\nManage one or several Gold Wings in your garage. Store details, accessories, and photos for each bike, and personalize the app with your favourite factory Gold Wing color.\n\nREFERENCE AT YOUR FINGERTIPS\n• Specifications for your GL1800\n• User manuals\n• A dealer directory\n• Emergency contact card and emergency-start guidance\n• Tire pressure reference\n• Quick links to weather apps and Wings-related social channels\n• Cruiseman's maintenance and how-to videos\n\nDESIGNED FOR RIDERS\nThe app features a clean, glanceable interface with a classic amber instrument-panel look, gentle sounds and haptics you can switch off, and full support for both metric and imperial units. Set it up once with a simple first-run wizard and you're ready to ride.\n\nEverything a Gold Wing owner needs to inspect, maintain, fuel, track, and enjoy their motorcycle — in one app made by riders, for riders. Fire it up, check it over, and hit the road.",
